1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:05,595
Peanut butter instead of butter! This toast is a little treat for your heart.

2
00:00:06,595 --> 00:00:11,395
One slice of whole-wheat bread, half an apple, and twenty grams of peanut butter.

3
00:00:12,395 --> 00:00:16,806
Wash and core the apple, then slice it thinly. Keep the peel on!

4
00:00:17,806 --> 00:00:22,663
Choose one hundred percent peanuts, with no added sugar or salt. Spread it evenly!

5
00:00:23,663 --> 00:00:27,940
Layer on the apple slices. Crunchy toast, ready to go!

6
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:33,395
Still rich and nutty, even without butter! Here's why I picked this snack.

7
00:00:34,395 --> 00:00:40,994
Replacing saturated fat with unsaturated fat can help manage LDL, the bad cholesterol.

8
00:00:41,994 --> 00:00:48,611
So swap butter for peanut butter! It's a replacement, not an extra serving. That's the heart-friendly choice.

9
00:00:49,611 --> 00:00:54,100
Taking care of your heart is great, but please don't eat the chef's snack too!

10
00:00:55,100 --> 00:01:04,100
Subscribe for your employee badge! Likes are your bonus!
